#face-image: img/portraits/GesslerOtto.jpg

= Otto Gessler

Otto Gessler is a prominent figure from the <span style="color: #DCCA4A;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span> and longtime Minister of Defence.

- @military_affairs
- @police_affairs
- @snap_election
- @root: Return to main

@military_affairs
title: Military Affairs
subtitle: We can set our military policy.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 and spd_in_government and reichswehr_minister_party == dvp_name
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if not dvp_in_government : The <span style="color: var(--dvp-color);">**[+ dvp_name +]**</span> is not in government. ?][? if reichswehr_minister_party != dvp_name: The <span style="color: var(--dvp-color);">**[+ dvp_name +]**</span> does not have the Reichswehr ministry. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; last_advisor_action = 1
go-to: military_policy


@police_affairs
title: Police Affairs 
subtitle: We can set our police policy. 
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 and dvp_in_government and interior_minister_party == dvp_name
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if not dvp_in_government: The <span style="color: var(--dvp-color);">**[+ dvp_name +]**</span> is not in government. ?][? if interior_minister_party != dvp_name: The <span style="color: var(--dvp-color);">**[+ dvp_name +]**</span> does not have the Interior ministry. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; police_timer -= 6; last_advisor_action = 1
go-to: police


@snap_election
title: Snap Election
subtitle: Call a snap election.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if president != "Gessler" : Gessler must be Chancellor or President. ?][? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 and (president == "Gessler")
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; time_to_election = 3
call: set_next_election_time

We have called for new elections, set for [+ next_election_month : month +] [+ next_election_year +].
